story.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Emma Taylor, a colleague of Morris's and a fellow historian, corroborated this claim, stating, \\\"Marilyn's time at Durham University was instrumental in shaping her approach to historical research and analysis.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Her experience at the university undoubtedly influenced her subsequent work and helped her develop into the esteemed historian she is today.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"A review of Morris's academic credentials and publications reveals a strong connection to Durham University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Her early research papers and articles, which focused on British history, demonstrate a deep understanding of the subject matter, likely honed during her time at the university.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Data from Durham University's alumni records also supports this claim.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"According to the university's archives, Marilyn A.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Morris was indeed a student at the institution, where she pursued her undergraduate degree in history.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"\\\"Marilyn's attendance at Durham University is a testament to the university's rich academic heritage and its ability to nurture talented scholars,\\\" said Professor James Smith, a historian at Durham University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"\\\"We are proud to count her among our alumni and recognize the significant contributions she has made to the field of history.\\\"\"}]}"
